[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 39602.31, "timestamp": "11:00:02", "text": "我可能真的會搬家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39605.266, "timestamp": "11:00:05", "text": "。所以我就想，喔耶，這裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39624.87, "timestamp": "11:00:24", "text": "有適合我的音樂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39628.39, "timestamp": "11:00:28", "text": "。  總之，這音樂我並不介意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39635.35, "timestamp": "11:00:35", "text": "。所以，嗯，我們會……我們會……我會……我會……我會……我會……嗯……搬到我之前待的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39658.23, "timestamp": "11:00:58", "text": "地方，對吧？  意思是，呃，"}]